OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of Man livestock worrying law
OL,4,Ato be reviewed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man's livestock worrying
OL,7,Flaws are to be reviewed after the
OL,8,Fresults of a public consultation
OL,9,Fsuggested strong support for
OL,10,Firresponsible dog owners to face
OL,11,Ftougher punishments.
OL,13,FOf the nearly 250 people who responded,
OL,14,F87% said the current law was not
OL,15,Fsufficiently robust, the Manx
OL,16,Fgovernment said.
OL,18,FLivestock worrying occurs when a dog
OL,19,Fchases, attacks or distresses
OL,20,Flivestock. It can either kill or injure
OL,21,Fanimals directly or cause pregnant ewes
OL,22,Fto lose their lambs.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,451,445,260,140,0,100
