OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of Man livestock worrying law
OL,4,Ato be reviewed
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're still relying on a law from 1990
OL,7,Fthat is not terribly effective when
OL,8,Finvestigating attacks, so you have to
OL,9,Fcatch the dog in the act," complained
OL,10,FSarah Comish, general secretary of the
OL,11,FManx National Farmers' Union.
